From: Gezim <gezimos@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 19:07:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 099/101] Kompakt: SPA pages turn a page per swipe

The Compose pages of Settings (All apps and the other SPA lists, and every
RegularScaffold page) scrolled with the finger while the rest of Settings
turns pages. kompaktPaged() takes the drag instead: every 56 dp of travel
turns a page. A LazyColumn (AppList, LazyCategory) goes forward to the first
row the bottom edge cuts and back a viewport with the top row whole; a
scrolling Column (RegularScaffold) moves a viewport. Their own scrolling is
off (userScrollEnabled = false, verticalScroll enabled = false).

Change-Id: Ia42eefce67f638173437c429df5ea745733e08f9
